{"name":"Belladonna","hex":"#220011","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Belladonna","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A taxonomic genus within the family Solanaceae – Atropa."]},{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Belladonna"}],"entries":[{"title":"Atropa bella-donna","blocks":[{"text":"Atropa bella-donna, commonly known as deadly nightshade or belladonna, is a toxic perennial herbaceous plant in the nightshade family Solanaceae, which also includes tomatoes, potatoes and eggplant. It is native to Europe and Western Asia, including Turkey, its distribution extending from England in the west to western Ukraine and the Iranian province of Gilan in the east. It is also naturalised or introduced in some parts of Canada, North Africa and the United States."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0a/Atropa_belladonna_%2816627871072%29.jpg/330px-Atropa_belladonna_%2816627871072%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atropa_bella-donna","wikidata":"Q156091"},{"title":"Amaryllis belladonna","blocks":[{"text":"Amaryllis belladonna, the Jersey lily, belladonna-lily, naked-lady-lily, or March lily, is a plant species native to Cape Province in South Africa but widely cultivated as an ornamental. It is reportedly naturalized in many places: Corsica, Portugal, the Azores, Madeira, the Canary Islands, the Scilly Isles of Great Britain, the Democratic Republic of the Congo, Ascension Island, Australia, New Zealand, Mexico, Cuba, Haiti, the Dominican Republic, Chile, California, Texas, Louisiana, Mississippi, Michigan, Indiana and the Juan Fernández Islands."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Naked_Ladies%2C_Hinsdale_Rhododendron_Garden_%2815022561349%29.jpg/330px-Naked_Ladies%2C_Hinsdale_Rhododendron_Garden_%2815022561349%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaryllis_belladonna","wikidata":"Q159792"},{"title":"Belladonna (actress)","blocks":[{"text":"Michelle Sinclair, known professionally as Belladonna, is an American former pornographic film and erotic actress, director, producer, and model. Since announcing her retirement from pornography in 2012, she has acted in several mainstream films, including Inherent Vice and The Ladies of the House."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Belladonna_2010.jpg/330px-Belladonna_2010.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belladonna_(actress)","wikidata":"Q231665"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Atropa_belladonna_Mann.jpg/500px-Atropa_belladonna_Mann.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Atropa_belladonna_Mann.jpg/1280px-Atropa_belladonna_Mann.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Atropa_belladonna_Mann.jpg/500px-Atropa_belladonna_Mann.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Atropa belladonna by Johann Gottlieb Mann, 1828","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAtropa_belladonna_Mann.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Atropa_bella-donna_sl27.jpg/500px-Atropa_bella-donna_sl27.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Atropa_bella-donna_sl27.jpg/1280px-Atropa_bella-donna_sl27.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Atropa_bella-donna_sl27.jpg/500px-Atropa_bella-donn